## Scope of the data licence

The dataset contains **no third-party program data**. It publishes only the
aggregate and categorical outcome of the author's own submissions. No protocol
names, chain names, reward tables, sponsor correspondence, or audit-report
content from any third party is included or redistributed.

`data/` is a derived artefact generated by `scripts/build_public_export.py`
from a private source that is not part of this repository.
